WEBVTT

00:14:29.093 --> 00:14:31.505
In all this world of instant gratification

00:14:31.529 --> 00:14:34.577
and 24/7, on-demand results,

00:14:34.601 --> 00:14:38.729
scientists require persistence,
vision and patience

00:14:38.753 --> 00:14:40.286
to rise above all that.

00:14:40.816 --> 00:14:45.729
They can see that the fork in the road
is not always a dilemma or a detour;

00:14:45.753 --> 00:14:49.063
sometimes, even though
we may not know it at the time,

00:14:49.087 --> 00:14:50.754
the fork is the way home.

00:14:51.452 --> 00:14:52.778
Thank you very much.

00:14:52.802 --> 00:14:56.678
(Applause)